            "sid": "EST 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami Ahasuero yaniga avandu vi vivala viosi via yamiha harara na avandu vi vivala vikagatanaa kunyanza kutunga uvusuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivikolwa vivie viosi viezingulu kandi viuvunyali, kandi ilivaala liosi liu luyali lonene lwa Modekai, lwu mwami yamuha vunyali ku vami va Pasia na Midia viang'odwa mu vitabu via kale via Vami va Pasia na Media. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Modekai Umuyuda, yaali wu kutanga mu vwamihi vwu mwami Ahasuero. Yaali wu luyali kandi ya yaanzwa ligali na Avayuda vache. Yakola miyinzi kwenyeleriza uvugasu vwa avandu veve kandi yenyeleriza nokoleta mirembe ku avandu veve vosi harara ni visukululwi viavo viosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.10.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
